Package: geomorphR
Type: Package
Title: Geometric Features for Building Footprints in sf
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Jonathan", "Cohen", email = "cohen.jota@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A focused R package that extracts geometric and morphological descriptors from polygon and multipolygon building footprint geometries in sf objects using a standardized, transparent feature API.
